   - SpMax_A (Leading eigenvalue from adjacency matrix) - Highlights molecular topology.
   - SM6_L, SM6_B(m) (Spectral moment measures of order 6) - Relates bulk molecular topology weighted by Laplace or mass-derived info.
   - HyWi_B(m) (Hyper-Wiener-like index weighted by mass) - Captures molecular flexibility and complexity.

4. Structural topology measures:
   - LOC (Lopping centric index) - Quantifies branching complexity of molecular graphs.
