   - SdO (Sum of dO E-states) - Indicates polar oxygen connectivity and electrostatic characteristics.
   - TI2_L (Second Mohar index) - Accounts for molecular graph structure variations.

These features capture critical chemical, structural, and connectivity properties tied to biodegradability.
